# Multi-workspace Gitignore (Antigravity Backup)

# --- Sensitive Data ---
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local
**/.metadata
**/apps_backup.json

# --- Python ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.pytest_cache/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/.env/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/

# --- Node.js ---
**/node_modules/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*

# --- IDE & System ---
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/.git/
**/.gemini/

# --- Project Specific ---
**/output/
**/temp/
**/*.tmp
